/S /H3
/T (In conclusion, this project not only emphasizes the importance of detecting driver fatigue but also highlights the potential of using advanced machine learning and sensor technologies to create a safer driving experience. By implementing this device, it is possible to save countless lives and prevent accidents, reinforcing the importance of innovation in promoting road safety.)
